### ---------- Category slug ----------

### 18. By category slug (expect 5 items, ids 25 down to 21)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?categorySlug=mens-shoes

### 19. Unknown slug (expect 200, data [], total 0)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?categorySlug=not-exists

### 20. Empty slug is ignored (expect total 30)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?categorySlug=

### 21. Slug with search (expect 2 corsets)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?categorySlug=evening-wear&search=corset

### 22. Slug with price, same result as test 17 (expect 2)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?categorySlug=mens-shoes&maxPrice=10000

### 23. Id and slug that disagree (expect total 0)
GET http://localhost:3000/products?categoryId=1&categorySlug=mens-shoes